PAGES={
'about':('About AniLove India','An anime-first guide to legal viewing','AniLove India is an independent discovery website for India, owned by Nitesh Patel. It lists official YouTube uploads of anime series, anime movies, Hindi movies and K-dramas, and plays them in YouTube’s embedded player on this site. Watching is free and no account is needed. We do not host video files, sell subscriptions, or claim a relationship with the services we link to. Only uploads from official, identity-reviewed publisher channels are listed, including Muse Asia, Muse India, Muse Hindi Dub, TMS, KBS WORLD TV, Goldmines, Shemaroo Movies and GUNDAM CHANNEL INTL. Fan re-uploads and pirate streams are never listed. Hindi-dub editions, Japanese audio with English subtitles, and English dubs are labelled per season or edition. An uploader may restrict an episode by region or age, and AniLove cannot override those controls.'),
'editorial-team':('Editorial team','A transparent editorial desk','Nitesh Patel owns and maintains this project. Launch guides were drafted with AI assistance and reviewed for the scope of the linked official sources. No professional film credentials, partnerships or personal viewing experiences are claimed. Factual corrections are welcome at niteshpatel7479@gmail.com.'),
'contact':('Contact','Talk to the editor','Request an anime, flag a source problem, or suggest a correction. Please include the title, language, season, your country and the official source URL if you have one. This form opens WhatsApp with a message to Nitesh at +91 79748 23298. Review and send it there; messages are not stored on this website.'),
'privacy':('Privacy Policy','Your viewing, your choice','Google AdSense code is installed on this site. If the site is approved to serve ads, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies, similar technologies, IP addresses and other identifiers to deliver, limit the frequency of, personalize and measure advertising, prevent fraud and produce aggregated reports. Depending on your location and applicable choices, ads may be personalized or non-personalized. You can manage Google ad personalization at https://myadcenter.google.com/ and read how Google uses information from partner sites at https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites. Information about Google’s advertising cookies is available at https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on a user’s prior visits to this or other websites. Browser settings can control some cookies, but blocking them may affect site features or advertising. Where law or Google’s policies require a consent choice, the relevant consent interface and choices apply. We do not promise that changing browser settings alone withdraws consent already recorded by an advertising provider. Search runs on your device. Continue-watching links and preferences use local storage. Watchlists remain in this browser until you clear them. No authentication service or independent user database is used. Episode thumbnails load from YouTube image servers, which receive connection data such as your IP address. YouTube players load only after you choose to load one, and may process IP addresses, cookies and device information under Google’s policies. No YouTube player is preloaded. Request forms open WhatsApp with the details you entered. Sending is completed in WhatsApp, under its privacy policy. For deletion, clear site data using Settings or your browser’s data controls.'),
' terms':('Terms','Use the guide responsibly','AniLove India provides official YouTube embeds and episode information. Availability, subtitles, age classifications and subscription requirements can change. You must meet each provider’s age and account requirements. We do not bypass regional restrictions, memberships or paywalls. We provide no unauthorized video downloads. Use of third-party services is governed by their terms. This information is provided without a promise of uninterrupted access or catalogue completeness.'),
'sourcing':('Content sourcing & verification','An official source is the beginning','Only official full-length YouTube uploads are embedded. Selected episodes can be listed after uploader, runtime and embed-metadata checks, with actual India playback labelled separately. Complete-season badges require an expected episode list and checks of every episode. Official playlists can contain additional uploads; their presence is not a verified-complete label. YouTube oEmbed and country metadata checks do not establish actual playback. India playback stays unverified until tested from an appropriate environment. Season completion and overall series completion are separate fields. Trailers never count as episodes. Missing evidence keeps candidates out of the playable catalogue. We display source YouTube thumbnails with their episodes. Uploader attribution and metadata check dates are retained with each title.'),
'corrections':('Corrections & reporting','Help keep the guide accurate','Use the report button on any title or contact niteshpatel7479@gmail.com. Include the page, provider URL, issue and relevant region. Reports are reviewed by the owner; submitting a report does not itself change the catalogue. Automated HTTP checks cannot prove playback or licensing and never silently promote a title to verified status.'),
'copyright':('Copyright & removal requests','Respect for creators comes first','We embed official YouTube uploads and do not store copies of films or episodes. To request removal or correct authorization information, email niteshpatel7479@gmail.com with the affected URL, the work identified, your authority to act and supporting details. The owner will review the request. Third-party title names belong to their respective owners. Our abstract editorial graphics are original and do not depict official characters or claim to be promotional posters.'),
'accessibility':('Accessibility','Made for more ways to explore','Navigation and controls support keyboard use, visible focus, native form labels and reduced-motion preferences. Layouts adapt to small screens. Horizontal title rows have labelled controls and keyboard access. Video embeds retain provider controls. If you find a barrier, email the page URL and describe the problem. We aim for accessible use and do not claim a completed independent WCAG certification.'),
}
