FAQ=[('What is AniLove India?','AniLove India is an independent discovery website for India that lists official YouTube uploads of anime series, anime movies, Hindi movies and K-dramas and plays them in YouTube’s embedded player. It does not host videos, sell subscriptions or require an account.'),('Is AniLove India legal and free?','Yes. It only lists uploads from official, identity-reviewed publisher channels and plays them in YouTube’s own embedded player. Watching is free and no account is needed.'),('Which anime are available in Hindi dub on AniLove India?','Hindi-dub editions are labelled per season. Season 1 of Assassination Classroom and Seasons 1 and 2 of JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure are listed complete in Hindi. Open a title and choose its Hindi season tab.'),('How do I watch?','Search a title, choose an episode and press Play. The official YouTube player opens on this website.'),('What if I cannot find a title?','The search results show a request form when nothing matches. Enter the title and preferred language, then send the prepared WhatsApp message to Nitesh.'),('Do I need to sign up?','No. Watching is open. Watch later saves on this device without an account.'),('Why does a video show a restriction?','The uploader controls region access, age restrictions and embedding. We cannot override those controls. Please report unavailable videos.'),('Are these complete seasons?','Checked uploads are listed individually; the official playlist player may contain additional episodes. A season is labelled complete only after its expected episode list and availability have been checked.'),('How can I install the app?','Open Settings and choose Install, or use your browser’s Add to Home Screen menu.')]
ARTICLES=[('watch-anime-here','How to watch anime on AniLove','GET STARTED','Search. Pick an episode. Press play.',[('One simple search','Use the search bar to find a title by its English, original or alternate name. There are no long filter forms.'),('Watch on this website','Open a title, choose one of its listed episodes and press Play. The standard YouTube player stays on this website, with YouTube’s controls, fullscreen and uploader attribution.'),('Request something missing','If your search has no results, the request form appears immediately. Add the title and language you want. It opens WhatsApp with your request addressed to Nitesh for you to review and send.'),('When an upload changes','YouTube uploaders can change regional access or remove videos. If an episode stops working, use Report a playback problem.')],['https://www.youtube.com/t/terms']),('understand-uploaded-episodes','Which episodes are available?','WATCHING GUIDE','The episode list tells you exactly what is on the shelf.',[('Episodes first','Each title lists actual official uploads. We do not substitute a trailer, recap or fan edit for a full episode.'),('Language editions','Audio and subtitle labels refer to the uploaded edition. A Japanese upload without confirmed English subtitles is not labelled English-subtitled.'),('Completion is separate','A set of selected episodes is not a complete season. Full-season labels need a reliable expected episode list and a check of every required upload.'),('Your region matters','An embed can be enabled while a video remains restricted in some countries. India playback is not called verified from a server-side metadata check.')],['https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/171780']),('jojo-hindi-complete','JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure in Hindi Is Now Complete','ANI LOVE NEWS','Seasons 1 and 2 of JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure are now listed complete in Hindi on AniLove India, alongside the already-complete Season 3 — 113 Hindi episodes from official Muse India uploads.',[('What is complete','Season 1 Hindi lists all 26 episodes: Phantom Blood (1–9) and Battle Tendency (10–26). Season 2 Hindi lists all 48 Stardust Crusaders episodes. Season 3 Hindi lists all 39 Diamond is Unbreakable episodes. Season 4 Hindi (Golden Wind) is listed with 14 checked episodes so far and continues to grow.'),('How the Hindi run was found','The Hindi seasons are older Muse India uploads that sat deeper in the channel’s catalogue than the first sweep reached. A deeper enumeration of Muse India uploads surfaced the full runs, and each episode passed the usual checks: official channel identity, full runtime, embedding metadata and India country metadata.'),('Where to start watching','Begin at Season 1 Episode 1 and watch in order. On the title page, choose the Hindi season tab first — the same story also exists in Japanese editions with English subtitles, and the tabs keep them apart.')],['https://aniloveindia.vercel.app/title/jojos-bizarre-adventure/','https://www.youtube.com/@MuseIndiaChannel'],('25 October 2026','2026-10-25')),('assassination-classroom-hindi-finale','Assassination Classroom Season 1 Hindi: The Finale Has Landed','ANI LOVE NEWS','All 22 episodes of Assassination Classroom Season 1 are now listed in Hindi on AniLove India, closing Muse India’s daily Hindi broadcast run that began on 3 October 2026.',[('The run, start to finish','Muse India premiered the Hindi dub as a daily broadcast at 8:30 PM IST from 3 October 2026. The 22nd and final episode landed on 24 October 2026, completing Season 1 Hindi on AniLove.'),('What Season 1 covers','Class 3-E, the End Class, must assassinate Koro-sensei — their unkillable, Mach-20 teacher — before graduation, while he teaches them lessons no other teacher could. The Hindi season follows the full broadcast order.'),('What about Season 2?','No Season 2 Hindi uploads have been found on Muse India yet, so Season 2 Hindi is not listed. If an official Hindi run appears, it will be checked and added the same way.')],['https://aniloveindia.vercel.app/title/assassination-classroom/','https://www.youtube.com/@MuseIndiaChannel'],('25 October 2026','2026-10-25')),('watch-hindi-dubbed-anime-legally','How to Watch Hindi-Dubbed Anime Legally in India','WATCHING GUIDE','Hindi-dubbed anime is scattered across official YouTube channels. Here is how to find it, tell a real dub from a re-upload, and watch it free on AniLove India.',[('Start with the official channel','Legal Hindi dubs on YouTube come from the publisher’s own channel — Muse India and Muse Hindi Dub for most of the anime here. AniLove only lists uploads from identity-reviewed official channels, so a Hindi label on a title page means that edition was checked against the official source.'),('Check the edition, not just the title','Hindi audio belongs to a particular upload. The same anime can exist in Hindi, in Japanese with English subtitles, and in English dub as separate editions. Always open the season tab that names the language you want; the title alone does not promise a dub.'),('Free does not mean pirated','The uploads AniLove embeds are free on YouTube itself, so watching them here costs nothing and needs no account. If an episode shows a region restriction, that is the uploader’s control — AniLove cannot override it, and fan re-uploads are never substituted to work around it.')],['https://aniloveindia.vercel.app/sourcing/','https://www.youtube.com/@MuseIndiaChannel'],('25 October 2026','2026-10-25'))]
